{
 "encounter_id": "00685",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hi, I'm Dr Okafor. How would you like me to address you, Ms Reyes, or Dana? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Dana's fine. I've got about twenty minutes before my next meeting, so, can we get into it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Of course. Tell me what's going on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My periods are awful. Painful periods, since I was fourteen. I've put up with it for years, but it's getting worse and I'm missing work."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Worse how?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It used to be a day of cramps. Now it's three, four days, and I'm on the bathroom floor on the second one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How heavy is the bleeding?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heavy. Soaking through a pad every hour or two on day two."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain with sex?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. Deep inside, it's why I stopped a while back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Interesting. Since when, roughly, has the sex been painful? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Maybe two years? Look, can we stick to the periods? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Sure. Do you bleed between periods?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Never between."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any unusual discharge or a smell?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble when you pass a stool during your period?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my bowels are normal, that's the one thing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you take anything for it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just ibuprofen, but that's ancient history now. It stopped helping. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sulfa drugs. I broke out in hives."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good to know. What else is in your medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Migraines with aura, anxiety, and I was anemic last year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any procedures?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A laparoscopy, four years ago, to look for... something. They didn't find anything."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with period problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had endometriosis. She was diagnosed in her thirties."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about work."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a paralegal. Back-to-back meetings, which is why I'm checking the clock."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I run three times a week, except when I'm in pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me take a few numbers. Your blood pressure is 112 over 70, pulse 76, and weight 59 kilos.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. I'm going to press on your abdomen. Tell me if it hurts.",
   "pause": 8.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah. Lower left, there. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness in the lower left abdomen, but no guarding."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What's guarding? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When the muscles tense up against my hand. They aren't. The uterus feels normal in size."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So, not big? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not big. And I can feel some tenderness behind the uterus too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's the part that hurts, yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your bladder?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing there. It's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This pattern, pain since your teens, deep pain with sex, your mother's history, it looks like endometriosis. I can't rule out fibroids until we scan."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Which means? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a pelvic ultrasound, a ferritin blood test for the iron, and a pregnancy test today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Pregnancy, no, there's no chance. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's routine before starting medication. I'd also like to start norethindrone 5 mg once a day, no estrogen because of the migraines with aura."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, that makes sense. Anything for the cramps? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes, let's start naproxen 500 mg twice a day with food during your period."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, I'll take that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the pain isn't better in three months, I'll refer you to a specialist for a closer look."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three months. Fine, I have to run. ~"
  }
 ],
